
---
import SiteLayout from "../../layouts/SiteLayout.astro";
---

<SiteLayout
    title="Philosophy — Antemundane sprǣc"
    description="Explore philosophy through questions about knowledge, existence, belief, and human thought."
>
    <section class="subject-hero">
        <p class="eyebrow">EXPLORE THE QUESTIONS OF EXISTENCE</p>

        <h1>Philosophy</h1>

        <p class="subject-introduction">
            From the nature of consciousness to the foundations of
            knowledge, philosophy is an attempt to examine our deepest
            assumptions and understand the world through critical thought.
        </p>

        <p class="subject-secondary">
            Question. Reflect. Challenge. Understand.
        </p>
    </section>

    <section class="subject-explore">
        <div class="section-heading">
            <p class="eyebrow">FIND YOUR DIRECTION</p>
            <h2>Explore Philosophy</h2>
            <p>
                Philosophy begins with questions that do not always
                have simple answers. Choose a field and begin thinking.
            </p>
        </div>

        <div class="subject-branches">
            <a class="subject-branch" href="/philosophy/epistemology/">
                <span class="branch-number">01</span>
                <h3>Epistemology</h3>
                <p>
                    What is knowledge? How can we distinguish
                    truth from belief, and what can we truly know?
                </p>
                <span class="branch-link">Explore knowledge →</span>
            </a>

            <a class="subject-branch" href="/philosophy/religion/">
                <span class="branch-number">02</span>
                <h3>Religion</h3>
                <p>
                    Examine questions about faith, existence,
                    divinity, meaning, and the nature of belief.
                </p>
                <span class="branch-link">Explore beliefs →</span>
            </a>

            <a class="subject-branch" href="/philosophy/forum/">
                <span class="branch-number">03</span>
                <h3>Forum</h3>
                <p>
                    Exchange arguments, challenge assumptions,
                    and discuss philosophical questions.
                </p>
                <span class="branch-link">Join the discussion →</span>
            </a>

            <a class="subject-branch" href="/philosophy/games/">
                <span class="branch-number">04</span>
                <h3>Fun Games</h3>
                <p>
                    Explore philosophical dilemmas and thought
                    experiments through interactive challenges.
                </p>
                <span class="branch-link">Play and reflect →</span>
            </a>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="subject-questions">
        <p class="eyebrow">A FEW QUESTIONS TO BEGIN WITH</p>
        <h2>Where curiosity begins</h2>

        <ul>
            <li>How can we know that anything exists beyond our own consciousness?</li>
            <li>Are our decisions truly free, or are they determined by prior events?</li>
            <li>Can something be meaningful even if it has no objective purpose?</li>
        </ul>
    </section>
</SiteLayout>
